{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06100","headline":"过沈居士山居哭之 · 王维","name":"过沈居士山居哭之","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"杨朱来此哭，桑扈返於真。\n独自成千古，依然旧四邻。\n闲檐喧鸟鹊，故榻满埃尘。\n曙月孤莺啭，空山五柳春。\n野花愁对客，泉水咽迎人。\n善卷明时隐，黔娄在日贫。\n逝川嗟尔命，丘井叹吾身。\n前後徒言隔，相悲讵几晨。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王维","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_06100.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06100","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}